@startuml scan_review_state
' DermaTrack — Scan review status (derived from presence of a doctor_notes row).
' The doctor patient list flags scans with no note as "needs review".
title Scan review status
[*] --> Unreviewed : patient submits scan
Unreviewed : no doctor_notes row;\nshown under "needs review"
Unreviewed --> Reviewed : doctor writes note\n(requires patient consent)
Reviewed : doctor_notes row exists;\npatient sees "From your dermatologist"
Reviewed --> Reviewed : doctor edits note
Reviewed --> [*]
Unreviewed --> [*] : patient deletes scan
@enduml
